source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: scss/at-rule/function-default-blocks.scss
---

# Input

```scss
$gap:8px;
@function --blocks(--value: {a,   #{ $gap }},--other:fn({a; b !important},[c, d])   tail){result:var(--value)}
@function --sequence(--value:first {a:  b} last,--empty:{/* empty */}){result:var(--value)}
@function --comments(--value:/* first */ {a, /* middle */ #{ $gap }} /* last */,--other:[c, d]){result:var(--value)}
.after{color:red}

```


# Formatted

```scss
$gap: 8px;
@function --blocks(
	--value: {a, #{$gap}},
	--other: fn({a; b !important}, [c, d]) tail
) {
	result: var(--value);
}
@function --sequence(--value: first {a: b} last, --empty: {/* empty */}) {
	result: var(--value);
}
@function --comments(
	--value: /* first */ {a, /* middle */ #{$gap}} /* last */,
	--other: [c, d]
) {
	result: var(--value);
}
.after {
	color: red;
}

```
